2062	## purpose and must be used corresponding to the Lattice IP Packager
2063	## documentation: https://www.latticesemi.com/view_document?document_id=54003.
2064	## Currently automatically selects the wrapper type from .v and .sv, but
2065	## the VHDL wrapper type is not currently supported by this script.
